# The VM cannot share controller Podman storage, so TMT syncs the local OCI
# archive to the single guest before migration. It reboots once, then verifies
# preserved /var data.
summary: Package-mode /var preservation
duration: 45m
adjust:
  - when: running_env == image_mode
    enabled: false
    because: this migration test requires a package-mode target
test: bash booted/package-mode/test-to-existing-root-preserve-var.sh
